    "classification": "FINANCE_MIRROR_REPRODUCES_ELIAHOU_HERCHER",
    "reason": "the Collatz transposition of Theorem 4.4 reproduces Eliahou's period bound and lattice at 2^40 and Hercher's bound at 2^68 from the same inequality, walk and brute force agreeing; the Juggler side reproduces the laboratory's own survivors"
